<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-IJL ups Computer Products.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-IJL ups Computer Products.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane raised its rating on Computer Products Inc to a buy from a neutral and gave the stock a price target of $25.</p>
<p>-- In a research report, the firm said it was also &quot;fine tuning&quot; 1997 earnings per share estimates down $0.02 to $1.00.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 17-1/8.</p>
</text>
